  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the bhuna sauce, mustard paste, salt, and pepper, and stir well.",
    "Add the shirataki noodles and stir to combine with the sauce.",
    "Reduce heat to low and let it simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the cheddar and mozzarella cheese until melted and well combined.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
